    H["4. Host<br/>SSH keys only, hardened containers (non-root, read-only), Wazuh agent, file integrity monitoring"] --> A
    A["5. Application<br/>Per-app role gates, minimum necessary, TLS"] --> D
    D["6. Data<br/>Classification, encryption, integrity hashes, retention"] --> M
    M["7. Monitoring and response<br/>Wazuh correlation rules, SOC triage, IR playbooks, case tracker"]
